# A56: assembly additions: a component mirrored about an assembly plane (se_assembly mirror) and components found by their
# document status (se_component_query, criterion status). A 10 mm cube in work and another available; the cube at x 50
# mirrored about the yz plane lands at x -50.
@pa = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"part"}
se_primitive {"shape":"box","center":[0,0,0],"size":[10,10],"depth":10}
se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a56\\a56_work.par","overwrite":true}
@st = se_documents {"action":"status","value":"in_work"}
se_documents {"action":"save"}
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
@pb = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"part"}
se_primitive {"shape":"box","center":[0,0,0],"size":[10,10],"depth":10}
se_documents {"action":"save_as","path":"{{work}}\\a56\\a56_free.par","overwrite":true}
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
@as = se_documents {"action":"new","kind":"assembly"}
@o1 = se_assembly {"action":"insert","path":"{{work}}\\a56\\a56_work.par","origin":[50,10,0],"ground":false}
@o2 = se_assembly {"action":"insert","path":"{{work}}\\a56\\a56_free.par","origin":[0,40,0]}
@m = se_assembly {"action":"mirror","occurrence":"{{o1.handle}}","plane":"yz"}
?= m.mirrored.origin[0] -50 0.001
?~ m.mirrored.name a56_work.par:2
?~ m.of a56_work.par:1
@g = se_geometry {"source":"{{m.mirrored.handle}}"}
?= g.boundingBox.max[0] -45 0.001
?= g.boundingBox.min[0] -55 0.001
! [invalid_argument] se_assembly {"action":"mirror","occurrence":"{{o1.handle}}"}
@q = se_component_query {"action":"find","criteria":[{"property":"status","value":"in_work"}]}
?= q.count 2
?~ q.components a56_work.par
@q0 = se_component_query {"action":"find","criteria":[{"property":"status","value":"available"}]}
?= q0.count 1
?~ q0.components a56_free.par
@qn = se_component_query {"action":"find","criteria":[{"property":"status","condition":"is_not","value":"in_work"}]}
?= qn.count 1
! [invalid_argument] se_component_query {"action":"find","criteria":[{"property":"status","value":"done"}]}
se_documents {"action":"close","saveChanges":false}
